msgid "IPv4 Hosts (%s)"
msgstr "Òstes IPv4 (%s)"


#: luci-app-omr-tracker/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-tracker/network/interface.js:228
msgid ""
"IPv4 address or hostname used instead of the hosts list to check the "
"connection and latency when no VPS is defined. Leave empty to use the hosts "
"list."
msgstr "Adreça IPv4 o nom d'òste utilizat en luòc de la lista d'òstes per verificar la connexion e la laténcia quand cap de VPS es pas definit. Daissatz void per utilizar la lista d'òstes."


#: luci-app-omr-tracker/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-tracker/network/interface.js:199
msgid "IPv6"
msgstr "IPv6"


#: luci-app-omr-tracker/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-tracker/network/interface.js:216
#: luci-app-omr-tracker/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-tracker/network/proxy.js:81
msgid "IPv6 Hosts (%s)"
msgstr "Òstes IPv6 (%s)"


#: luci-app-omr-tracker/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-tracker/network/interface.js:234
msgid ""
"IPv6 address or hostname used instead of the hosts list to check the "
"connection and latency when no VPS is defined. Leave empty to use the hosts "
"list."
msgstr "Adreça IPv6 o nom d'òste utilizat en luòc de la lista d'òstes per verificar la connexion e la laténcia quand cap de VPS es pas definit. Daissatz void per utilizar la lista d'òstes."


#: luci-app-omr-tracker/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-tracker/network/interface.js:187
#: luci-app-omr-tracker/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-tracker/network/proxy.js:42
#: luci-app-omr-tracker/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-tracker/network/server.js:41
msgid "Initial state"
msgstr "Estat inicial"


#: luci-app-omr-tracker/root/usr/share/luci/menu.d/luci-app-omr-tracker.json:13
msgid "Interface"
msgstr "Interfàcia"


#: luci-app-omr-tracker/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-tracker/network/interface.js:414
msgid "Interface down"
msgstr "Interfàcia en pana"


#: luci-app-omr-tracker/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-tracker/network/interface.js:412
msgid "Interface state"
msgstr "Estat de l'interfàcia"


#: luci-app-omr-tracker/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-tracker/network/interface.js:430
msgid "Interface up"
msgstr "Interfàcia activa"


#: luci-app-omr-tracker/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-tracker/network/interface.js:415
msgid "Interface will be deemed down after this many failed ping tests"
msgstr "L'interfàcia serà considerada en pana aprèp aqueste nombre de tèsts de ping fracassats"


#: luci-app-omr-tracker/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-tracker/network/interface.js:195
#: luci-app-omr-tracker/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-tracker/network/proxy.js:49
msgid "Internet Protocol"
msgstr "Protocòl Internet"


#: luci-app-omr-tracker/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-tracker/network/interface.js:405
msgid "Keep failure interval"
msgstr "Gardar l'interval de fracàs"


#: luci-app-omr-tracker/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-tracker/network/interface.js:406
msgid "Keep ping failure interval during failure state"
msgstr "Gardar l'interval de ping de fracàs pendent l'estat de fracàs"


#: luci-app-omr-tracker/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-tracker/network/interface.js:294
#: luci-app-omr-tracker/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-tracker/network/server.js:83
msgid ""
"Latency above this value is treated as a failure while quality checks are "
"enabled."
msgstr "Una laténcia superiora a aquesta valor es considerada coma un fracàs quand las verificacions de qualitat son activadas."


#: luci-app-omr-tracker/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-tracker/network/interface.js:319
msgid ""
"Latency must fall below this value before the interface is considered "
"recovered."
msgstr "La laténcia deu davalar en dejós d'aquesta valor abans que l'interfàcia siá considerada coma restablida."


#: luci-app-omr-tracker/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-tracker/network/server.js:108
msgid ""
"Latency must fall below this value before the server is considered healthy "
"again."
msgstr "La laténcia deu davalar en dejós d'aquesta valor abans que lo servidor siá considerat en bona santat tornarmai."


#: luci-app-omr-tracker/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-tracker/network/interface.js:251
#: luci-app-omr-tracker/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-tracker/network/proxy.js:100
#: luci-app-omr-tracker/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-tracker/network/server.js:55
msgid "Mail alert"
msgstr "Alèrta per corrièl"


#: luci-app-omr-tracker/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-tracker/network/interface.js:288
msgid ""
"Mark the interface down when latency, packet loss or congestion crosses the "
"thresholds below."
msgstr "Marca l'interfàcia en pana quand la laténcia, la pèrda de paquets o la congestion despassa los sulhets çaijós."


#: luci-app-omr-tracker/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-tracker/network/interface.js:273
msgid "Max TTL"
msgstr "TTL maximal"


#: luci-app-omr-tracker/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-tracker/network/interface.js:274
msgid "Maximum TTL or hop limit allowed for ping-based checks."
msgstr "TTL maximal o limit de sauts autorizat per las verificacions basadas sul ping."


#: luci-app-omr-tracker/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-tracker/network/server.js:133
msgid ""
"Maximum time to wait for each API or ping test before it is counted as "
"failed."
msgstr "Temps maximal d'espèra per cada tèst d'API o de ping abans qu'siá comptat coma fracassat."


#: luci-app-omr-tracker/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-tracker/network/proxy.js:123
msgid ""
"Maximum time to wait for each proxy test before it is counted as failed."
msgstr "Temps maximal d'espèra per cada tèst de proxy abans qu'siá comptat coma fracassat."


#: luci-app-omr-tracker/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-tracker/network/interface.js:158
msgid ""
"Maximum time to wait for each test response before it is counted as failed."
msgstr "Temps maximal d'espèra per cada responsa de tèst abans qu'siá comptada coma fracassada."


#: luci-app-omr-tracker/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-tracker/network/interface.js:376
msgid ""
"Minimum delay between two runs of the post-tracking scripts while the "
"interface is down. State changes always trigger them immediately. Leave "
